module gunbc.cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_scaffold



data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_scaffold_note: String = "THE REALIZATION IS SCAFFOLD EVEN THOUGH THE POLICY ABOVE IT IS MODELED, and that distinction is the whole reason this row exists (operator ruling on gunbc#7804, 2026-08-04). gunbc.witness_deferral_freeze and v2.workflow.witness_admission are the authority: the frozen population, the two standing axes and both gates are .dag facts. What lands in cli_run.rs is one REALIZATION of them — a text scan over three .dag authorities, a git baseline reader, and the enforcement path the floor calls — and the .dag side being correct does not exempt it. cli_run.rs is the largest hand-maintained Rust wall in the program and it is already growing against its own hollowing plan, so several hundred more lines may not enter unaccounted merely because the policy above them is modeled well.

MEASURED AT LANDING, so the accounting is a fact rather than an impression: 505 added production lines and 364 added test lines, against 30 removed. The production half is three things and no more — the FrozenPathDeferral and CommitWitnessClaim source scans, the git-baseline monotonicity reader, and the classification plus refusal path the floor invokes.

WHY IT IS HAND-RUST TODAY rather than a modeling failure: the floor's admission step runs before any .dag evaluation is available to it, over a population the host itself discovered by walking the source roots, so the check has to execute where the walk is. That is the same constraint the sibling scan already carries (cli_run_witness_admission_source_scan_scaffold), and this block deliberately reuses its shape and its parsing helpers rather than inventing a second idiom — one scaffold with two subjects is cheaper to delete than two scaffolds.

FAIL-CLOSED IN BOTH DIRECTIONS, which is what makes an interim scan tolerable: an unparseable row head PANICS with its location rather than yielding no key, because a silently dropped freeze row would refuse a legitimately frozen witness; and a consumer expressed in an unrecognized form yields no key, so its row surfaces as a loud refusal rather than being absorbed."

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_scaffold: std.disposition.Disposition = std.disposition.Scaffold {
  dissolves_to: SingleAuthority,
  bind: std.decl_ref.DeclarationRef {
    module_path: "v1_compiler.cli_run",
    decl_name: "frozen_path_deferral_keys",
    field: WholeDeclaration
  }
}

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_dissolve_trigger: std.dissolution.DissolutionCondition = unbound_dissolution(description: "DISSOLVE-ON, in the order the operator specified and with each step's own condition, so this is a sequence rather than an aspiration. STEP 1 — seed realization, which is what landed: frozen_path_deferral_keys, commit_roster_witness_claim_keys, classify_deferred_discovery_rows and collect_frozen_path_deferral_additions_against read the .dag authorities by text scan. STEP 2 — the frozen-deferral projection is emitted or natively realized from gunbc.witness_deferral_freeze rather than scanned, on the same route the witness-realization lane is already building for the other rosters; the parsing helpers (frozen_path_deferral_keys_from_source, commit_roster_witness_claim_keys_from_source, quoted_after_field, bracket_list_after_field, quoted_literals) delete at that point. STEP 3 — the classification and refusal path follows the projection, at which point the whole block including the git baseline reader deletes and the floor consumes the .dag gates directly. THE STRICTER CONDITION, and it dissolves this row entirely rather than shrinking it: the frozen population reaching zero removes the freeze, the path-policy pass-through arm and every line of this block together, because with no legacy debt there is nothing for the ratchet to tolerate. Whichever fires first, nothing here is permanent surface.")

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_production_loc_delta: Int = 505

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_test_loc_delta: Int = 364

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_removed_loc_delta: Int = 30

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_loc_delta_basis: String = "HOW THESE WERE MEASURED, stated so the number is reproducible rather than merely asserted: git diff against the merge-base with origin/main, restricted to src/v1/stage0/src/cli_run.rs, with each added line classified by whether it falls inside a top-level cfg-test module span. The three figures partition exactly — 505 plus 364 equals the 869 added lines the diff reports, and 30 is the removals. Both halves are named because a reader given only a total cannot tell added from touched, and the two differ here by exactly the removals.

THESE NUMBERS WERE WRONG WHEN FIRST AUTHORED and the correction is recorded rather than quietly applied, because a silently repaired measurement teaches nothing. The first values, 487 production and 371 test, were measured before the operator handbacks were amended into this branch and were never re-measured afterwards; they understated the total by 9 lines and misallocated 16 between the halves. Nothing consumed them, so nothing broke — which is exactly why it survived: a stated fact with no consumer has no mechanism to notice it going stale, and this row asserts an accounting is a fact rather than an impression, so a wrong figure here is the failure this PR is about, one layer in. Surfaced by review 48200 quoting a 897-line growth: at the head that review read, the diff was 867 added plus 30 removed, so its figure was lines TOUCHED and was never in conflict with these — but answering it is what exposed the drift, which is the argument for naming both halves above. The correcting commit then moved the number a second time, by two production lines, because the doc-comment repair it carries is itself inside the measured file. That is not an embarrassment to hide: it is the recipe's whole point, and it is why the instruction is to re-measure at the FINAL head rather than at the moment the figure feels settled.

WHY THESE ARE STILL NOT WITNESS-ASSERTED, unchanged by the correction: a live count would be a change detector over a file every lane edits, and the roster-registry ruling on stored counts applies to Rust lines exactly as it applies to roster rows. They are a DATED LANDING MEASUREMENT — they exist so the growth this scaffold accounts for is a stated quantity, and so the deletion at dissolution has a size to be checked against. The residual hazard is named rather than papered over: being unasserted is precisely what let the first pair rot, so a later amend to this block must re-measure by the recipe above, and the honest ceiling of this row is a dated fact, never a live invariant."

data cli_run_witness_deferral_freeze_authority_anchor: String = "gunbc.witness_deferral_freeze witness_deferral_freeze_authority_note"
